# 4. Processing Queue

## Suggested View Name

`v_processing_queue`

## Purpose

Operations teams usually only need to see applicants that still require action.

Completed applications generally do not belong on operational dashboards.

This view filters the database to show only applicants who are still being processed.

---

## Recommended Source Tables

- `intake`

---

## Suggested Information

- Applicant Name
- Current Stage
- Current Status
- Assigned Reviewer
- Priority
- Retry Count
- Follow-up Date

---

## Common Use Cases

- Daily work queue
- Operations dashboard
- AI processing pipeline
- Review management

---

## Example SQL

```sql
CREATE VIEW v_processing_queue AS

SELECT
    intake_id,
    full_name,
    application_stage,
    status,
    assigned_reviewer
FROM intake
WHERE status NOT IN ('Accepted', 'Rejected');
```

