# 6. Source Performance

## Suggested View Name

`v_source_performance`

## Purpose

Many organizations receive applicants from multiple recruitment channels.

Management often wants to understand which sources produce the strongest candidates.

This view aggregates applicant statistics by recruitment source.

---

## Recommended Source Tables

- `sources`
- `intake`

---

## Suggested Information

- Source Name
- Source Type
- Total Applicants
- Accepted Applicants
- Rejected Applicants
- Average AI Score
- Acceptance Rate

---

## Common Use Cases

- Recruitment analytics
- Marketing attribution
- Partner evaluation
- Executive reporting

---

## Example SQL

```sql
CREATE VIEW v_source_performance AS

SELECT
    s.source_name,
    COUNT(*) AS total_applicants,
    AVG(i.final_agency_score) AS average_score
FROM sources s
JOIN intake i
ON s.source_id = i.source_id
GROUP BY s.source_name;
```

