# 7. Reviewer Workload

## Suggested View Name

`v_reviewer_workload`

## Purpose

As applicant volume grows, managers need visibility into reviewer assignments and workload distribution.

This view summarizes review activity for each reviewer.

---

## Recommended Source Tables

- `users`
- `intake`

---

## Suggested Information

- Reviewer Name
- Total Assigned Applicants
- Pending Reviews
- Completed Reviews
- Escalated Reviews
- Current Workload

---

## Common Use Cases

- Team management
- Capacity planning
- Performance reporting
- Workload balancing

---

## Example SQL

```sql
CREATE VIEW v_reviewer_workload AS

SELECT
    assigned_reviewer,
    COUNT(*) AS assigned_candidates
FROM intake
GROUP BY assigned_reviewer;
```

